<title>JAPAN: Hokkaido Takushoku Bank slumps in afternoon.</title>
<headline>Hokkaido Takushoku Bank slumps in afternoon.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hokkaido Takushoku Bank Ltd shares slumped in Thursday afternoon trade, falling below the 200 yen level for the first time since January 1979, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0456 GMT, it was down 18 yen at 195 yen in volume of 2.08 million shares.</p>
</text>
